{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_15","type":"agent_message","text":"The failure is concentrated in two assumptions: cart hydration treats a missing SKU as a fatal cart error, and order response mapping re-queries the product instead of relying on the order’s snapshot fields. I’m changing cart hydration to discard only missing lines, preserving the cart, and making missing-product lookups resolve as “not found” so add/product APIs return 404 while order snapshots remain readable."}}
